This is a demo application about mathematical audio synthesis.
The consept is the that the user supplies an expression that depends on time to sample from to generate audio.

Desktop version of this demo uses SDL 3 and companion libraries of SDL_ttf and SDL_image. They are included as git submodules in the vendor/ folder.
Desktop version uses CMake for building.
There is a new web version developement of which is going on under the web/ folder
